Backport the TLS 1.3 receive-cancellation fix, including its regression test.
Keep the pending record reader and TLS shutdown under the same read lock.
Add the qualified exception import required by TLS 2.4.3.
https://github.com/haskell-tls/hs-tls/commit/218abdd67a4cde30854b5ca9b146b269da53bc07

